---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Privacy policy - Lars Graubner";
const description = "How larsgraubner.com processes personal data.";
---

<Layout {title} {description}>
  <div class="max-w-160">
    <h1
      class="font-serif text-4xl leading-none font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-6xl"
    >
      Privacy policy
    </h1>

    <div class="post-body mt-16">
      <h2>Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Lars Graubner<br />
        Percevalstr. 38<br />
        23564 Lübeck<br />
        Germany<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:hello@larsgraubner.com">hello@larsgraubner.com</a
        >
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This website is hosted on bunny.net, a content delivery network operated
        by BunnyWay d.o.o., Dunajska cesta 165, 1000 Ljubljana, Slovenia. When
        you visit a page, its servers process the data your browser sends: your
        IP address, the date and time of the request, the requested URL, the
        referrer, and your browser's user agent. This is necessary to deliver
        the website and keep it secure. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR.
        Access logs store your IP address only in anonymized form and are
        deleted after three days. Bunny processes this data on my behalf under a
        data processing agreement according to Art. 28 GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses <a href="https://usefathom.com/">Fathom Analytics</a>,
        provided by Conva Ventures Inc., Canada, to count page views. Fathom
        sets no cookies and does not store personal data or build user profiles.
        Your IP address is only used briefly to recognize unique visits and is
        not stored. The legal basis is my legitimate interest in understanding
        how this website is used, Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR. The European Commission
        has decided that Canada provides an adequate level of data protection.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact by email</h2>
      <p>
        If you email me, I process your address and your message to answer you.
        The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR, or Art. 6 (1) (b) GDPR if your
        message concerns a contract. I delete the messages when they are no
        longer needed, unless legal retention periods apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and external resources</h2>
      <p>
        This website sets no cookies. Fonts are served from this website itself.
        Apart from the analytics script described above, pages load no resources
        from third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to access your personal data, to have it corrected or
        deleted, to restrict its processing, to data portability, and to object
        to processing based on Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR. To exercise these rights,
        email me at the address above.
      </p>
      <p>
        You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection
        supervisory authority. The authority responsible for me is the <a
          href="https://www.datenschutzzentrum.de/"
          >Unabhängiges Landeszentrum für Datenschutz Schleswig-Holstein</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
